  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<p>2 vs. 2 Cursed Technique Battles</p>\n<p>Aim to become the strongest together by taking advantage of the characteristics of each technique, aiming for a Joint Attack that is triggered by combining attacks, and working together in harmony to assess the battle situation!</p>\n<p>Characters with their own unique Cursed Technique</p>\n<p>Familiar members such as Yuji Itadori, Megumi Fushiguro, Nobara Kugisaki, and Satoru Gojo, as well as Cursed Spirits such as Jogo and Hanami, will also participate in the game.</p>\n<p>Each character has his or her own unique Cursed Technique and actions.</p>\n<p><b>Master a New Domain in the Battle!</b><br>\nAs you grow in battle, more powerful techniques and latent abilities blossom.</p>\n<p>Embrace the core of the Cursed Energy and win in the intensifying battle situation!</p>\n<p>Unleash the super dreadnought Cursed Technique and seize the victory!</p>\n<p>At the end of the game, when both players are fully developed, powerful techniques clash with each other.</p>\n<p>The player must overwhelm his or her opponent dynamically, just as in the anime!</p>\n<p><b>Included DLCs:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Jujutsu High First-Years Outfit Set\n</li><li>Digital Artbook &amp; Soundtrack\n</li><li>Jujusta 2024\n</li><li>Hidden Inventory/Premature Death\n</li><li>Shibuya Incident\n</li><li>Anime Ending Theme 1 Outfit Set\n</li><li>Kyoto Jujutsu High School Girls’ Outfit Set\n</li></ul>\n",
